    target: data_point
  - name: Composite traffic model v. 1.0.1 (Analytica)
    authority: Jouni T Tuomisto and Marko Tainio (National Public Health 
      Institute KTL)
    url: https://doi.org/10.1186/1471-2458-5-123
    description: 'Additional file 1 of the article: CompositeTraffic_1_0_1.ana, Analytica
      3.1 XML, URN:NBN:fi-fe20051439. Trip data, road network, trip aggregation code,
      precomputed aggregation results for 85 scenarios (Scen1_0, Trips1_0), cost elements
      and decision analysis.; Attachment: source_material/12889_2005_278_MOESM1_ESM.ana;
      Format: Analytica model (XML); Licensing: CC BY 2.0; Geographic Coverage: Helsinki
      metropolitan area; Date Last Updated: 2005-11-03; Updated by: BioMed Central'
    edition:
    target: data_point
  - name: EMEP/EEA Guidebook 2023 tyre, brake and road wear
    authority: European Environment Agency
    url: 
      https://www.eea.europa.eu/en/analysis/publications/emep-eea-guidebook-2023/part-b-sectoral-guidance-chapters/1-energy/1-a-combustion/1-a-3-b-vi/@@download/file
    description: 'EMEP/EEA air pollutant emission inventory guidebook 2023, chapter
      1.A.3.b.vi-vii, Tier 2 tyre, brake and road wear factors with PM2.5 mass fractions
      and speed corrections.; Attachment: source_material/current_2025/emep_eea_guidebook_2023_1A3bvi-vii.pdf;
      Format: PDF report; Geographic Coverage: Europe; Date Last Updated: 2023-12-01;
