    description: 'Energy use of the electric Proace Verso: WLTP 241-264 Wh/km incl.
      charging losses, real-world estimate 265 Wh/km, city 179 (mild) to 246 (cold).;
      Attachment: source_material/current_2025/ev_database_toyota_proace_verso_l_75kwh.html;
