    description: 'Publication of real-world CO2 emissions and fuel consumption of
      cars and vans collected in 2022 (26.7.2024), from on-board fuel consumption
      meters: petrol cars first registered in 2022 use 21.1 % (1.3 l/100 km) more
      than type approval, about 7.5 l/100 km.; Format: Web page; Geographic Coverage:
      EU; Date Last Updated: 2024-07-26; Updated by: European Commission'
    edition:
    target: data_point
