    description: '"In 2025, the average real-time emission factor for the electricity
      consumed in Finland was 26 g CO2/kWh."; Attachment: source_material/current_2025/fingrid_climate_impact.html;
      Format: Web page; Geographic Coverage: Finland; Date Last Updated: 2026-11-26;
